+# Project Eval demo
+
+This demo runs the curated ai-gateway customer-service eval set through
+EvalScope. The generator and the synthetic agent wrapper live in the sibling
+Evalith repository; EvalScope only imports `eval_set.v1.jsonl` and executes it.
+
+## Prerequisites
+
+```bash
+# Evalith wrapper (first build copies ai-gateway to .evalith/build)
+/Users/bytedance/项目/Evalith/examples/aigateway/http-adapter/build.sh
+
+# deterministic mock model used by the demo
+python /Users/bytedance/项目/Evalith/examples/aigateway/http-adapter/mock_llm.py &
+
+# wrapper in L2 mode
+cd /Users/bytedance/项目/Evalith
+EVAL_AGENT_PORT=9201 \
+EVAL_AGENT_STATE_DIR="$PWD/.evalith/aigateway" \
+EVAL_AGENT_LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9300/v1 \
+EVAL_AGENT_LLM_API_KEY=mock \
+EVAL_AGENT_LLM_MODEL=mock \
+.evalith/bin/ai-gateway-adapter &
+```
+
+## Run
+
+```bash
+# L2
+python examples/project_eval/run_demo.py --mode l2 \
+  --judge-url http://127.0.0.1:9301/v1 --judge-key EMPTY
+
+# L0: restart the wrapper with EVAL_AGENT_TRACE_MODE=l0 first
+python examples/project_eval/run_demo.py --mode l0 \
+  --judge-url http://127.0.0.1:9301/v1 --judge-key EMPTY
+```
+
+Outputs go to `outputs/demo-aigateway-<mode>/` and are gitignored. The curated
+eval set is
+`/Users/bytedance/项目/Evalith/examples/aigateway/evalscope/eval_set.v1.jsonl`.
+Checks query the wrapper's real SQLite DB; keep the wrapper state dir
+(`EVAL_AGENT_STATE_DIR`, default `.evalith/aigateway`) as `project_root`.
+
+## Dashboard
+
+```bash
+.venv/bin/evalscope service --host 127.0.0.1 --port 9000 \
+  --outputs ./outputs --enable-project-eval \
+  --eval-set-root /Users/bytedance/项目/Evalith/examples/aigateway/evalscope
+```
+
+Open `http://127.0.0.1:9000/eval-sets`, import the JSONL, and run.
